					<description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;#160; This eBook explains how organizations in the Power &amp;#38; Utilities industry can evolve from scattered, uncontrolled engineering information to a governed, connected, and AI-ready digital foundation. It introduces Asset Information Lifecycle Management (AILM) as the extension of engineering document control across the full asset lifecycle—keeping engineering records aligned with the physical plant as assets [&amp;#8230;]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The post &lt;a href="https://www.powermag.com/white-papers/asset-information-lifecycle-management-the-digital-backbone-of-trusted-operations-compliance-ai/"&gt;Asset Information Lifecycle Management: The Digital Backbone of Trusted Operations, Compliance, &amp;#038; AI&lt;/a&gt; appeared first on &lt;a href="https://www.powermag.com"&gt;POWER Magazine&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
